 "provenance": "Bavaria 7 (w1 l6) secret exit 34,38, control-only on the exact S700 core. Start: lives 12 (campaign-style value used by earlier routes), weaponTier 2 (hook obtained in Bavaria 3), maxHealth 4, 0 diamonds. Route: from the entrance to checkpoint 23,36; hammer the bridge switch 25,37 from below (25,38) so the three stones on row 34 drop past the hero; hook stone 24,32 to 25,32; hammer switch 23,34 from 24,34 to restore the bridges (the hooked stone lands at 25,34 beside the hero); climb column 25 through the lowered bridges, step into grass 25,27, break the brick row 26 with one hit; wait for the roller 27,26 to roll away down column 25; walk row 26 to 31,26 and down column 31 (cutting grass) to row 38 and right to the secret exit. No damage taken.",
